scn 1
# Three Aramon flying builders (arafly) in one cell: the first puts a Keep's site down (air_traffic orders it
# at tick 2: VTOL_MobileBuild) and the other two help (VTOL_HelpBuild). Both missions wake every tick of their
# work, and at 8 on the air-traffic counter (41f0a6, 41f981) step the builder out of the stack
# (VTOL_StepOutNoFormation, StopBuilding) and start again from the approach; a MobileBuild whose site stands
# goes on as VTOL_HelpBuild (41f2d6). Through protocol 307's first cut the builders hovered as one stack.
name air-stack-help
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type flyb fbi arafly
group builders 0 flyb 3 cells 40,80 40,80 40,80
pair stack builders builders cells=2
